# The third mission, the Thargoid invasion, from the jump that gives it to the debriefing. It starts from
# invasion-mission.cdr (Tools/PrepareCommanders.py): the reference's own save at Lave with 127 jumps counted outside the
# first galaxy, one short of the mission (UpdateMissionSchedule gives it on the 128th), a galactic hyperdrive, an escape
# capsule, a military laser aft and 10,000 credits. The galactic jump to Esbete is the 128th counted, and the mission is
# given. The escape capsule takes the commander to Esbete's station, where the status screen briefs him
# (ShowMissionBriefing): the invasion is on, and the station may no longer be docked with. He buys another capsule and
# launches, and the aft military laser, in the rear view, destroys the station, at half damage while the invasion is on,
# which ends the invasion. The capsule takes him to the station again, but a capsule is no docking, so the status screen
# does not debrief him; he launches from a new station and docks by hand, with the keys launch-and-dock.replay docks
# with at Lave (a launch sets every station up alike), and the status screen debriefs him (ShowMissionDebriefing): the
# title Archangel (AwardArchangelTitle) and the anti-ECM emulator. The invasion's Thargoids spawn only in a system
# jumped to after the briefing, and this replay does not meet them.
file JAMESON.CDR invasion-mission.cdr
wait 0.5; key space; wait 3.5      # any key: the credits, then the status screen
key Escape; wait 0.3               # the disc menu
key l; wait 0.3                    # Load Commander: it asks for a file name
key j; key a; key m; key e; key s; key o; key n; key Return; wait 0.5
